  if (nagResult?.verdict === 'fail' && nagResult.concerns?.length > 0) {
    log(`Nag raised ${nagResult.concerns.length} concern(s) on DesignSpec — sending back to Designer for revision...`)
    designSpec = await run(
      `You are the Designer agent for {{PROJECT_NAME}}.

Your DesignSpec was reviewed and the following concerns were raised. Address them and produce a revised DesignSpec.

TaskSpec:
${JSON.stringify(taskSpec, null, 2)}

Current DesignSpec:
${JSON.stringify(designSpec, null, 2)}

Nag concerns:
