Your ImplementationPlan was reviewed and the following concerns were raised. Address them and produce a revised ImplementationPlan.

TaskSpec:
${JSON.stringify(taskSpec, null, 2)}

${designSpec ? `DesignSpec:\n${JSON.stringify(designSpec, null, 2)}` : 'DesignSpec: null'}

Current ImplementationPlan:
${JSON.stringify(implPlan, null, 2)}

Nag concerns:
${JSON.stringify(nagResult.concerns, null, 2)}`,
